  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Adolescent Girls to exercise their sexual &amp; reproductive health &amp; rights &amp; to realize their potential</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to ensure adolescents and young people are empowered to exercise their sexual and reproductive health and rights. The programme seeks to improve the knowledge of adolescents and their attitudes to sexual and reproductive health and rights, contribute to reducing GBV, as well as strengthening their life skills, leadership and livelihood opportunities for people living in Kigoma region including both people in local communities and those living in refugee camps. This is the fourth year grant.</narrative>
  </description>
